-
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  17, 'When he came to Samaria, he struck all who remained to Ahab in Samaria, until he had destroyed him, according to the word of ForeverOne, which he spoke to Elijah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  17, 'When he came to Samaria, he struck all who remained to Ahab in Samaria, until he had destroyed them, according to ForeverOne\'s word which he spoke to Elijah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  18, 'Jehu gathered all the people together, and said to them, \"Ahab served Baal a little; but Jehu will serve him much.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  18, 'Jehu gathered all the people together, and said to them, \"Ahab served Baal a little, but Jehu will serve him much.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  19, 'Now therefore call to me all the prophets of Baal, all of his worshippers, and all of his priests. Let none be absent; for I have a great sacrifice to Baal. Whoever is absent, he shall not live.\" But Jehu did it in subtlety, intending that he might destroy the worshippers of Baal.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  19, 'Now therefore call to me all the prophets of Baal, all of his worshippers, and all of his priests. Let no one be absent, for I have a great sacrifice to Baal. Whoever is absent, he shall not live.\" But Jehu did deceptively, intending to destroy the worshippers of Baal.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  20, 'Jehu said, \"Sanctify a solemn assembly for Baal!\" They proclaimed it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  20, 'Jehu said, \"Sanctify a solemn assembly for Baal!\" So they proclaimed it.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  22, 'He said to him who was over the vestry, \"Bring out robes for all the worshippers of Baal!\" He brought robes out to them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  22, 'He said to him who kept the wardrobe, \"Bring out robes for all the worshippers of Baal!\" So he brought robes out to them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  23, 'Jehu went with Jehonadab the son of Rechab into the house of Baal. Then he said to the worshippers of Baal, \"Search, and look that there are here with you none of the servants of ForeverOne, but the worshippers of Baal only.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  23, 'Jehu went with Jehonadab the son of Rechab into the house of Baal. Then he said to the worshippers of Baal, \"Search, and see that none of the servants of ForeverOne are here with you, but only the worshippers of Baal.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  24, 'They went in to offer sacrifices and burnt offerings. Now Jehu had appointed him eighty men outside, and said, \"If any of the men whom I bring into your hands escape, [he who lets him go], his life shall be for the life of him.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  24, 'So they went in to offer sacrifices and burnt offerings. Now Jehu had appointed for himself eighty men outside, and said, \"If any of the men whom I bring into your hands escape, he who lets him go, his life shall be for the life of him.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  25, 'It happened, as soon as he had made an end of offering the burnt offering, that Jehu said to the guard and to the captains, \"Go in, and kill them! Let none escape.\" They struck them with the edge of the sword; and the guard and the captains cast them out, and went to the city of the house of Baal.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  25, 'As soon as he had finished offering the burnt offering, Jehu said to the guard and to the captains, \"Go in and kill them! Let no one escape.\" So they struck them with the edge of the sword. The guard and the captains threw the bodies out, and went to the inner shrine of the house of Baal.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  26, 'They brought out the pillars that were in the house of Baal, and burned them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  26, 'They brought out the pillars that were in the house of Baal and burned them.');
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  29, 'However from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin, Jehu didn\'t depart from after them, [to wit], the golden calves that were in Bethel, and that were in Dan.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  29, 'However, Jehu didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin- the golden calves that were in Bethel and that were in Dan.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  30, 'ForeverOne said to Jehu, \"Because you have done well in executing that which is right in my eyes, [and] have done to the house of Ahab according to all that was in my heart, your sons of the fourth generation shall sit on the throne of Israel.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  30, 'ForeverOne said to Jehu, \"Because you have done well in executing that which is right in my eyes, and have done to Ahab\'s house according to all that was in my heart, your descendants shall sit on the throne of Israel to the fourth generation.\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  32, 'In those days ForeverOne began to cut off from Israel; and Hazael struck them in all the borders of Israel;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  10,  32, 'In those days ForeverOne began to cut away parts of Israel; and Hazael struck them in all the borders of Israel');
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   1, 'Now when Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she arose and destroyed all the offspring royal.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   1, 'Now when Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she arose and destroyed all the royal offspring.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   2, 'But Jehosheba, the daughter of king Joram, sister of Ahaziah, took Joash the son of Ahaziah, and stole him away from among the king\'s sons who were slain, even him and his nurse, [and put them] in the bedroom; and they hid him from Athaliah, so that he was not slain;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   2, 'But Jehosheba, the daughter of King Joram, sister of Ahaziah, took Joash the son of Ahaziah, and stole him away from among the king\'s sons who were slain, even him and his nurse, and put them in the bedroom; and they hid him from Athaliah, so that he was not slain.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   3, 'He was with her hidden in the house of ForeverOne six years. Athaliah reigned over the land.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   3, 'He was with her hidden in ForeverOne\'s house six years while Athaliah reigned over the land.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   4, 'In the seventh year Jehoiada sent and fetched the captains over hundreds of the Carites and of the guard, and brought them to him into the house of ForeverOne; and he made a covenant with them, and took an oath of them in the house of ForeverOne, and showed them the king\'s son.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   4, 'In the seventh year Jehoiada sent and fetched the captains over hundreds of the Carites and of the guard, and brought them to him into ForeverOne\'s house; and he made a covenant with them, and made a covenant with them in ForeverOne\'s house, and showed them the king\'s son.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   5, 'He commanded them, saying, \"This is the thing that you shall do: a third part of you, who come in on the Sabbath, shall be keepers of the watch of the king\'s house;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   5, 'He commanded them, saying, \"This is what you must do: a third of you, who come in on the Sabbath, shall be keepers of the watch of the king\'s house;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   6, 'A third part shall be at the gate Sur; and a third part at the gate behind the guard. So you shall keep the watch of the house, and be a barrier.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   6, 'a third of you shall be at the gate Sur; and a third of you at the gate behind the guard. So you shall keep the watch of the house, and be a barrier.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   7, 'The two companies of you, even all who go out on the Sabbath, shall keep the watch of the house of ForeverOne around the king.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   7, 'The two companies of you, even all who go out on the Sabbath, shall keep the watch of ForeverOne\'s house around the king.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   9, 'The captains over hundreds did according to all that Jehoiada the priest commanded; and they took every man his men, those who were to come in on the Sabbath, with those who were to go out on the Sabbath, and came to Jehoiada the priest.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,   9, 'The captains over hundreds did according to all that Jehoiada the priest commanded; and they each took his men, those who were to come in on the Sabbath with those who were to go out on the Sabbath, and came to Jehoiada the priest.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  10, 'The priest delivered to the captains over hundreds the spears and shields that had been king David\'s, which were in the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  10, 'The priest delivered to the captains over hundreds the spears and shields that had been King David\'s, which were in ForeverOne\'s house.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  12, 'Then he brought out the king\'s son, and put the crown on him, and [gave him] the testimony; and they made him king, and anointed him; and they clapped their hands, and said, \"Long live the king!\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  12, 'Then he brought out the king\'s son, and put the crown on him, and gave him the covenant; and they made him king and anointed him; and they clapped their hands, and said, \"Long live the king!\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  13, 'When Athaliah heard the noise of the guard [and of] the people, she came to the people into the house of ForeverOne:');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  13, 'When Athaliah heard the noise of the guard and of the people, she came to the people into ForeverOne\'s house;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  14, 'and she looked, and behold, the king stood by the pillar, as the tradition was, and the captains and the trumpets by the king; and all the people of the land rejoiced, and blew trumpets. Then Athaliah tore her clothes, and cried, \"Treason! Treason!\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  14, 'and she looked, and behold, the king stood by the pillar, as the tradition was, with the captains and the trumpets by the king; and all the people of the land rejoiced, and blew trumpets. Then Athaliah tore her clothes and cried, \"Treason! Treason!\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  15, 'Jehoiada the priest commanded the captains of hundreds who were set over the army, and said to them, \"Bring her out between the ranks. Kill him who follows her with the sword.\" For the priest said, \"Don\'t let her be slain in the house of ForeverOne.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  15, 'Jehoiada the priest commanded the captains of hundreds who were set over the army, and said to them, \"Bring her out between the ranks. Kill anyone who follows her with the sword.\" For the priest said, \"Don\'t let her be slain in ForeverOne\'s house.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  16, 'So they made way for her; and she went by the way of the horses\' entry to the king\'s house. She was slain there.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  16, 'So they seized her; and she went by the way of the horses\' entry to the king\'s house, and she was slain there.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  17, 'Jehoiada made a covenant between ForeverOne and the king and the people, that they should be ForeverOne\'s people; between the king also and the people.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  17, 'Jehoiada made a covenant between ForeverOne and the king and the people, that they should be ForeverOne\'s people; also between the king and the people.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  18, 'All the people of the land went to the house of Baal, and broke it down; his altars and his images broke they in pieces thoroughly, and killed Mattan the priest of Baal before the altars. The priest appointed officers over the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  18, 'All the people of the land went to the house of Baal, and broke it down. They broke his altars and his images in pieces thoroughly, and killed Mattan the priest of Baal before the altars. The priest appointed officers over ForeverOne\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  19, 'He took the captains over hundreds, and the Carites, and the guard, and all the people of the land; and they brought down the king from the house of ForeverOne, and came by the way of the gate of the guard to the king\'s house. He sat on the throne of the kings.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  19, 'He took the captains over hundreds, and the Carites, and the guard, and all the people of the land; and they brought down the king from ForeverOne\'s house, and came by the way of the gate of the guard to the king\'s house. He sat on the throne of the kings.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  20, 'So all the people of the land rejoiced, and the city was quiet. Athaliah they had slain with the sword at the king\'s house.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  11,  20, 'So all the people of the land rejoiced, and the city was quiet. They had slain Athaliah with the sword at the king\'s house.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   1, 'In the seventh year of Jehu began Jehoash to reign; and he reigned forty years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Zibiah of Beersheba.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   1, 'Jehoash began to reign in the seventh year of Jehu, and he reigned forty years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Zibiah of Beersheba.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   2, 'Jehoash did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne all his days in which Jehoiada the priest instructed him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   2, 'Jehoash did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes all his days in which Jehoiada the priest instructed him.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   3, 'However the high places were not taken away; the people still sacrificed and burnt incense in the high places.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   3, 'However, the high places were not taken away. The people still sacrificed and burned incense in the high places.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   4, 'Jehoash said to the priests, \"All the money of the holy things that is brought into the house of ForeverOne, in current money, the money of the persons for whom each man is rated, and all the money that it comes into any man\'s heart to bring into the house of ForeverOne,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   4, 'Jehoash said to the priests, \"All the money of the holy things that is brought into ForeverOne\'s house, in current money, the money of the people for whom each man is evaluated, and all the money that it comes into any man\'s heart to bring into ForeverOne\'s house,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   5, 'let the priests take it to them, every man from his acquaintance; and they shall repair the breaches of the house, wherever any breach shall be found.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   5, 'let the priests take it to them, each man from his donor; and they shall repair the damage to the house, wherever any damage is found.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   6, 'But it was so, that in the three and twentieth year of king Jehoash the priests had not repaired the breaches of the house.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   6, 'But it was so, that in the twenty-third year of King Jehoash the priests had not repaired the damage to the house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   7, 'Then king Jehoash called for Jehoiada the priest, and for the [other] priests, and said to them, \"Why don\'t you repair the breaches of the house? Now therefore take no more money from your treasurers, but deliver it for the breaches of the house.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   7, 'Then King Jehoash called for Jehoiada the priest, and for the other priests, and said to them, \"Why aren\'t you repairing the damage to the house? Now therefore take no more money from your treasurers, but deliver it for repair of the damage to the house.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   8, 'The priests consented that they should take no [more] money from the people, neither repair the breaches of the house.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   8, 'The priests consented that they should take no more money from the people, and not repair the damage to the house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   9, 'But Jehoiada the priest took a chest, and bored a hole in its lid, and set it beside the altar, on the right side as one comes into the house of ForeverOne: and the priests who kept the threshold put therein all the money that was brought into the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,   9, 'But Jehoiada the priest took a chest and bored a hole in its lid, and set it beside the altar, on the right side as one comes into ForeverOne\'s house; and the priests who kept the threshold put all the money that was brought into ForeverOne\'s house into it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  10, 'It was so, when they saw that there was much money in the chest, that the king\'s scribe and the high priest came up, and they put up in bags and counted the money that was found in the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  10, 'When they saw that there was much money in the chest, the king\'s scribe and the high priest came up, and they put it in bags and counted the money that was found in ForeverOne\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  11, 'They gave the money that was weighed out into the hands of those who did the work, who had the oversight of the house of ForeverOne: and they paid it out to the carpenters and the builders, who worked on the house of ForeverOne,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  11, 'They gave the money that was weighed out into the hands of those who did the work, who had the oversight of ForeverOne\'s house; and they paid it out to the carpenters and the builders who worked on ForeverOne\'s house,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  12, 'and to the masons and the stone cutters, and for buying timber and cut stone to repair the breaches of the house of ForeverOne, and for all that was laid out for the house to repair it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  12, 'and to the masons and the stone cutters, and for buying timber and cut stone to repair the damage to ForeverOne\'s house, and for all that was laid out for the house to repair it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  13, 'But there were not made for the house of ForeverOne cups of silver, snuffers, basins, trumpets, any vessels of gold, or vessels of silver, of the money that was brought into the house of ForeverOne;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  13, 'But there were not made for ForeverOne\'s house cups of silver, snuffers, basins, trumpets, any vessels of gold or vessels of silver, of the money that was brought into ForeverOne\'s house;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  14, 'for they gave that to those who did the work, and repaired therewith the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  14, 'for they gave that to those who did the work, and repaired ForeverOne\'s house with it.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  16, 'The money for the trespass offerings, and the money for the sin offerings, was not brought into the house of ForeverOne: it was the priests\'.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  16, 'The money for the trespass offerings and the money for the sin offerings was not brought into ForeverOne\'s house. It was the priests\'.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  17, 'Then Hazael king of Syria went up, and fought against Gath, and took it; and Hazael set his face to go up to Jerusalem.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  17, 'Then Hazael king of Syria went up and fought against Gath, and took it; and Hazael set his face to go up to Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  18, 'Jehoash king of Judah took all the holy things that Jehoshaphat and Jehoram and Ahaziah, his fathers, kings of Judah, had dedicated, and his own holy things, and all the gold that was found in the treasures of the house of ForeverOne, and of the king\'s house, and sent it to Hazael king of Syria: and he went away from Jerusalem.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  18, 'Jehoash king of Judah took all the holy things that Jehoshaphat and Jehoram and Ahaziah, his fathers, kings of Judah, had dedicated, and his own holy things, and all the gold that was found in the treasures of ForeverOne\'s house, and of the king\'s house, and sent it to Hazael king of Syria; and he went away from Jerusalem.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  20, 'His servants arose, and made a conspiracy, and struck Joash at the house of Millo, [on the way] that goes down to Silla.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  20, 'His servants arose and made a conspiracy, and struck Joash at the house of Millo, on the way that goes down to Silla.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  21, 'For Jozacar the son of Shimeath, and Jehozabad the son of Shomer, his servants, struck him, and he died; and they buried him with his fathers in the city of David: and Amaziah his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  12,  21, 'For Jozacar the son of Shimeath, and Jehozabad the son of Shomer, his servants, struck him, and he died; and they buried him with his fathers in David\'s city; and Amaziah his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   1, 'In the three and twentieth year of Joash the son of Ahaziah, king of Judah, Jehoahaz the son of Jehu began to reign over Israel in Samaria, [and reigned] seventeen years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   1, 'In the twenty-third year of Joash the son of Ahaziah, king of Judah, Jehoahaz the son of Jehu began to reign over Israel in Samaria for seventeen years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   2, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, and followed the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin; he didn\'t depart from it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   2, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, and followed the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin. He didn\'t depart from it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   3, 'The anger of ForeverOne was kindled against Israel, and he delivered them into the hand of Hazael king of Syria, and into the hand of Benhadad the son of Hazael, continually.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   3, 'ForeverOne\'s anger burned against Israel, and he delivered them into the hand of Hazael king of Syria, and into the hand of Benhadad the son of Hazael, continually.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   4, 'Jehoahaz begged ForeverOne, and ForeverOne listened to him; for he saw the oppression of Israel, how that the king of Syria oppressed them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   4, 'Jehoahaz begged ForeverOne, and ForeverOne listened to him; for he saw the oppression of Israel, how the king of Syria oppressed them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   5, '(ForeverOne gave Israel a savior, so that they went out from under the hand of the Syrians; and the children of Israel lived in their tents as before.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   5, 'ForeverOne gave Israel a savior, so that they went out from under the hand of the Syrians; and the children of Israel lived in their tents as before.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   6, 'Nevertheless they didn\'t depart from the sins of the house of Jeroboam, with which he made Israel to sin, but walked therein: and there remained the Asherah also in Samaria.)');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   6, 'Nevertheless they didn\'t depart from the sins of the house of Jeroboam, with which he made Israel to sin, but walked in them; and the Asherah also remained in Samaria.)');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   7, 'For he didn\'t leave to Jehoahaz of the people any more than fifty horsemen, and ten chariots, and ten thousand footmen; for the king of Syria destroyed them, and made them like the dust in threshing.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   7, 'For he didn\'t leave to Jehoahaz of the people any more than fifty horsemen, and ten chariots, and ten thousand footmen; for the king of Syria destroyed them and made them like the dust in threshing.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   9, 'Jehoahaz slept with his fathers; and they buried him in Samaria: and Joash his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,   9, 'Jehoahaz slept with his fathers; and they buried him in Samaria; and Joash his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  10, 'In the thirty-seventh year of Joash king of Judah began Jehoash the son of Jehoahaz to reign over Israel in Samaria, [and reigned] sixteen years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  10, 'In the thirty-seventh year of Joash king of Judah, Jehoash the son of Jehoahaz began to reign over Israel in Samaria for sixteen years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  11, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne; he didn\'t depart from all the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin; but he walked therein.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  11, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight. He didn\'t depart from all the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin; but he walked in them.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  13, 'Joash slept with his fathers; and Jeroboam sat on his throne: and Joash was buried in Samaria with the kings of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  13, 'Joash slept with his fathers; and Jeroboam sat on his throne. Joash was buried in Samaria with the kings of Israel.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  14, 'Now Elisha was fallen sick of his sickness of which he died: and Joash the king of Israel came down to him, and wept over him, and said, \"My father, my father, the chariots of Israel and its horsemen!\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  14, 'Now Elisha became sick with the illness of which he died; and Joash the king of Israel came down to him, and wept over him, and said, \"My father, my father, the chariots of Israel and its horsemen!\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  15, 'Elisha said to him, \"Take bow and arrows;\" and he took to him bow and arrows.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  15, 'Elisha said to him, \"Take bow and arrows;\" and he took bow and arrows for himself.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  16, 'He said to the king of Israel, \"Put your hand on the bow;\" and he put his hand [on it]. Elisha laid his hands on the king\'s hands.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  16, 'He said to the king of Israel, \"Put your hand on the bow;\" and he put his hand on it. Elisha laid his hands on the king\'s hands.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  17, 'He said, \"Open the window eastward;\" and he opened it. Then Elisha said, \"Shoot!\" and he shot. He said, \"ForeverOne\'s arrow of victory, even the arrow of victory over Syria; for you shall strike the Syrians in Aphek, until you have consumed them.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  17, 'He said, \"Open the window eastward;\" and he opened it. Then Elisha said, \"Shoot!\" and he shot. He said, \"ForeverOne\'s arrow of victory, even the arrow of victory over Syria; for you will strike the Syrians in Aphek until you have consumed them.\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  19, 'The man of God was angry with him, and said, \"You should have struck five or six times. Then you would have struck Syria until you had consumed it, whereas now you shall strike Syria just three times.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  19, 'The man of God was angry with him, and said, \"You should have struck five or six times. Then you would have struck Syria until you had consumed it, but now you will strike Syria just three times.\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  21, 'It happened, as they were burying a man, that behold, they spied a band; and they cast the man into the tomb of Elisha: and as soon as the man touched the bones of Elisha, he revived, and stood up on his feet.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  21, 'As they were burying a man, behold, they saw a band of raiders; and they threw the man into Elisha\'s tomb. As soon as the man touched Elisha\'s bones, he revived, and stood up on his feet.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  23, 'But ForeverOne was gracious to them, and had compassion on them, and had respect to them, because of his covenant with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, and would not destroy them, neither cast he them from his presence as yet.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  23, 'But ForeverOne was gracious to them, and had compassion on them, and favored them because of his covenant with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, and would not destroy them and he didn\'t cast them from his presence as yet.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  25, 'Jehoash the son of Jehoahaz took again out of the hand of Benhadad the son of Hazael the cities which he had taken out of the hand of Jehoahaz his father by war. Three times did Joash strike him, and recovered the cities of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  13,  25, 'Jehoash the son of Jehoahaz took again out of the hand of Benhadad the son of Hazael the cities which he had taken out of the hand of Jehoahaz his father by war. Joash struck him three times, and recovered the cities of Israel.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   1, 'In the second year of Joash son of Joahaz king of Israel began Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah to reign.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   1, 'In the second year of Joash, son of Joahaz, king of Israel, Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah began to reign.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   2, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign; and he reigned twenty-nine years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Jehoaddin of Jerusalem.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   2, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign; and he reigned twenty-nine years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Jehoaddin of Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   3, 'He did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne, yet not like David his father: he did according to all that Joash his father had done.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   3, 'He did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes, yet not like David his father. He did according to all that Joash his father had done.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   4, 'However the high places were not taken away: the people still sacrificed and burnt incense in the high places.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   4, 'However the high places were not taken away. The people still sacrificed and burned incense in the high places.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   5, 'It happened, as soon as the kingdom was established in his hand, that he killed his servants who had slain the king his father:');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   5, 'As soon as the kingdom was established in his hand, he killed his servants who had slain the king his father,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   6, 'but the children of the murderers he didn\'t put to death; according to that which is written in the book of the law of Moses, as ForeverOne commanded, saying, \"The fathers shall not be put to death for the children, nor the children be put to death for the fathers; but every man shall die for his own sin.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   6, 'but the children of the murderers he didn\'t put to death, according to that which is written in the book of the law of Moses, as ForeverOne commanded, saying, \"The fathers shall not be put to death for the children, nor the children be put to death for the fathers; but every man shall die for his own sin.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   7, 'He killed of Edom in the Valley of Salt ten thousand, and took Sela by war, and called its name Joktheel, to this day.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   7, 'He killed ten thousand Edomites in the Valley of Salt, and took Sela by war, and called its name Joktheel, to this day.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   8, 'Then Amaziah sent messengers to Jehoash, the son of Jehoahaz son of Jehu, king of Israel, saying, \"Come, let us look one another in the face.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   8, 'Then Amaziah sent messengers to Jehoash, the son of Jehoahaz son of Jehu, king of Israel, saying, \"Come, let\'s look one another in the face.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   9, 'Jehoash the king of Israel sent to Amaziah king of Judah, saying, \"The thistle that was in Lebanon sent to the cedar that was in Lebanon, saying, \'Give your daughter to my son as wife. Then a wild animal that was in Lebanon passed by, and trampled down the thistle.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,   9, 'Jehoash the king of Israel sent to Amaziah king of Judah, saying, \"The thistle that was in Lebanon sent to the cedar that was in Lebanon, saying, \'Give your daughter to my son as wife.\' Then a wild animal that was in Lebanon passed by, and trampled down the thistle.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  10, 'You have indeed struck Edom, and your heart has lifted you up. Enjoy the glory of it, and stay at home; for why should you meddle to your harm, that you should fall, even you, and Judah with you?\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  10, 'You have indeed struck Edom, and your heart has lifted you up. Enjoy the glory of it, and stay at home; for why should you meddle to your harm, that you fall, even you, and Judah with you?\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  12, 'Judah was defeated by Israel; and they fled every man to his tent.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  12, 'Judah was defeated by Israel; and each man fled to his tent.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  13, 'Jehoash king of Israel took Amaziah king of Judah, the son of Jehoash the son of Ahaziah, at Beth Shemesh, and came to Jerusalem, and broke down the wall of Jerusalem from the gate of Ephraim to the corner gate, four hundred cubits.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  13, 'Jehoash king of Israel took Amaziah king of Judah, the son of Jehoash the son of Ahaziah, at Beth Shemesh and came to Jerusalem, then broke down the wall of Jerusalem from the gate of Ephraim to the corner gate, four hundred cubits.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  14, 'He took all the gold and silver, and all the vessels that were found in the house of ForeverOne, and in the treasures of the king\'s house, the hostages also, and returned to Samaria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  14, 'He took all the gold and silver and all the vessels that were found in ForeverOne\'s house and in the treasures of the king\'s house, the hostages also, and returned to Samaria.');
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  17, 'Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah lived after the death of Jehoash son of Jehoahaz king of Israel fifteen years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  17, 'Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah lived after the death of Jehoash son of Jehoahaz, king of Israel, fifteen years.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  19, 'They made a conspiracy against him in Jerusalem; and he fled to Lachish: but they sent after him to Lachish, and killed him there.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  19, 'They made a conspiracy against him in Jerusalem, and he fled to Lachish; but they sent after him to Lachish and killed him there.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  20, 'They brought him on horses; and he was buried at Jerusalem with his fathers in the city of David.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  20, 'They brought him on horses, and he was buried at Jerusalem with his fathers in David\'s city.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  22, 'He built Elath, and restored it to Judah, after that the king slept with his fathers.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  22, 'He built Elath and restored it to Judah. After that the king slept with his fathers.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  23, 'In the fifteenth year of Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah Jeroboam the son of Joash king of Israel began to reign in Samaria, [and reigned] forty-one years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  23, 'In the fifteenth year of Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah, Jeroboam the son of Joash king of Israel began to reign in Samaria for forty-one years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  24, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne: he didn\'t depart from all the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  24, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight. He didn\'t depart from all the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  25, 'He restored the border of Israel from the entrance of Hamath to the sea of the Arabah, according to the word of ForeverOne, the God of Israel, which he spoke by his servant Jonah the son of Amittai, the prophet, who was of Gath Hepher.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  25, 'He restored the border of Israel from the entrance of Hamath to the sea of the Arabah, according to ForeverOne, the God of Israel\'s word, which he spoke by his servant Jonah the son of Amittai, the prophet, who was from Gath Hepher.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  26, 'For ForeverOne saw the affliction of Israel, that it was very bitter; for there was none shut up nor left at large, neither was there any helper for Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  26, 'For ForeverOne saw the affliction of Israel, that it was very bitter for all, slave and free; and there was no helper for Israel.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  28, 'Now the rest of the acts of Jeroboam, and all that he did, and his might, how he warred, and how he recovered Damascus, and Hamath, [which had belonged] to Judah, for Israel, aren\'t they written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  14,  28, 'Now the rest of the acts of Jeroboam, and all that he did, and his might, how he fought, and how he recovered Damascus, and Hamath, which had belonged to Judah, for Israel, aren\'t they written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   1, 'In the twenty-seventh year of Jeroboam king of Israel began Azariah son of Amaziah king of Judah to reign.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   1, 'In the twenty-seventh year of Jeroboam king of Israel, Azariah son of Amaziah king of Judah began to reign.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   2, 'Sixteen years old was he when he began to reign; and he reigned fifty-two years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Jecoliah of Jerusalem.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   2, 'He was sixteen years old when he began to reign, and he reigned fifty-two years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Jecoliah of Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   3, 'He did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne, according to all that his father Amaziah had done.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   3, 'He did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes, according to all that his father Amaziah had done.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   4, 'However the high places were not taken away: the people still sacrificed and burnt incense in the high places.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   4, 'However, the high places were not taken away. The people still sacrificed and burned incense in the high places.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   5, 'ForeverOne struck the king, so that he was a leper to the day of his death, and lived in a separate house. Jotham the king\'s son was over the household, judging the people of the land.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   5, 'ForeverOne struck the king, so that he was a leper to the day of his death, and lived in a separate house. Jotham, the king\'s son, was over the household, judging the people of the land.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   7, 'Azariah slept with his fathers; and they buried him with his fathers in the city of David: and Jotham his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   7, 'Azariah slept with his fathers; and they buried him with his fathers in David\'s city; and Jotham his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   8, 'In the thirty-eighth year of Azariah king of Judah did Zechariah the son of Jeroboam reign over Israel in Samaria six months.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   8, 'In the thirty-eighth year of Azariah king of Judah, Zechariah the son of Jeroboam reigned over Israel in Samaria six months.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   9, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, as his fathers had done: he didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,   9, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, as his fathers had done. He didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  10, 'Shallum the son of Jabesh conspired against him, and struck him before the people, and killed him, and reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  10, 'Shallum the son of Jabesh conspired against him, and struck him before the people and killed him, and reigned in his place.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  12, 'This was the word of ForeverOne which he spoke to Jehu, saying, \"Your sons to the fourth generation shall sit on the throne of Israel.\" So it came to pass.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  12, 'This was ForeverOne\'s word which he spoke to Jehu, saying, \"Your sons to the fourth generation shall sit on the throne of Israel.\" So it came to pass.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  13, 'Shallum the son of Jabesh began to reign in the thirty-ninth year of Uzziah king of Judah; and he reigned for a month in Samaria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  13, 'Shallum the son of Jabesh began to reign in the thirty-ninth year of Uzziah king of Judah, and he reigned for a month in Samaria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  14, 'Menahem the son of Gadi went up from Tirzah, and came to Samaria, and struck Shallum the son of Jabesh in Samaria, and killed him, and reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  14, 'Menahem the son of Gadi went up from Tirzah, came to Samaria, struck Shallum the son of Jabesh in Samaria, killed him, and reigned in his place.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  16, 'Then Menahem struck Tiphsah, and all who were therein, and its borders, from Tirzah: because they didn\'t open to him, therefore he struck it; and all the women therein who were with child he ripped up.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  16, 'Then Menahem attacked Tiphsah and all who were in it and its border areas, from Tirzah. He attacked it because they didn\'t open their gates to him, and he ripped up all their women who were with child.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  17, 'In the nine and thirtieth year of Azariah king of Judah began Menahem the son of Gadi to reign over Israel, [and reigned] ten years in Samaria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  17, 'In the thirty ninth year of Azariah king of Judah, Menahem the son of Gadi began to reign over Israel for ten years in Samaria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  18, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne: he didn\'t depart all his days from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  18, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight. He didn\'t depart all his days from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  19, 'There came against the land Pul the king of Assyria; and Menahem gave Pul one thousand talents of silver, that his hand might be with him to confirm the kingdom in his hand.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  19, 'Pul the king of Assyria came against the land, and Menahem gave Pul one thousand talents of silver, that his hand might be with him to confirm the kingdom in his hand.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  20, 'Menahem exacted the money of Israel, even of all the mighty men of wealth, of each man fifty shekels of silver, to give to the king of Assyria. So the king of Assyria turned back, and didn\'t stay there in the land.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  20, 'Menahem exacted the money from Israel, even from all the mighty men of wealth, from each man fifty shekels of silver, to give to the king of Assyria. So the king of Assyria turned back, and didn\'t stay there in the land.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  22, 'Menahem slept with his fathers; and Pekahiah his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  22, 'Menahem slept with his fathers, and Pekahiah his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  23, 'In the fiftieth year of Azariah king of Judah Pekahiah the son of Menahem began to reign over Israel in Samaria, [and reigned] two years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  23, 'In the fiftieth year of Azariah king of Judah, Pekahiah the son of Menahem began to reign over Israel in Samaria for two years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  24, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne: he didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  24, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight. He didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  25, 'Pekah the son of Remaliah, his captain, conspired against him, and struck him in Samaria, in the castle of the king\'s house, with Argob and Arieh; and with him were fifty men of the Gileadites: and he killed him, and reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  25, 'Pekah the son of Remaliah, his captain, conspired against him and attacked him in Samaria, in the fortress of the king\'s house, with Argob and Arieh; and with him were fifty men of the Gileadites. He killed him, and reigned in his place.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  27, 'In the two and fiftieth year of Azariah king of Judah Pekah the son of Remaliah began to reign over Israel in Samaria, [and reigned] twenty years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  27, 'In the fifty-second year of Azariah king of Judah, Pekah the son of Remaliah began to reign over Israel in Samaria for twenty years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  28, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne: he didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  28, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight. He didn\'t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  29, 'In the days of Pekah king of Israel came Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria, and took Ijon, and Abel Beth Maacah, and Janoah, and Kedesh, and Hazor, and Gilead, and Galilee, all the land of Naphtali; and he carried them captive to Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  29, 'In the days of Pekah king of Israel, Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria came and took Ijon, Abel Beth Maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, and Galilee, all the land of Naphtali; and he carried them captive to Assyria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  30, 'Hoshea the son of Elah made a conspiracy against Pekah the son of Remaliah, and struck him, and killed him, and reigned in his place, in the twentieth year of Jotham the son of Uzziah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  30, 'Hoshea the son of Elah made a conspiracy against Pekah the son of Remaliah, attacked him, killed him, and reigned in his place, in the twentieth year of Jotham the son of Uzziah.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  32, 'In the second year of Pekah the son of Remaliah king of Israel began Jotham the son of Uzziah king of Judah to reign.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  32, 'In the second year of Pekah the son of Remaliah king of Israel, Jotham the son of Uzziah king of Judah began to reign.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  33, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign; and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Jerusha the daughter of Zadok.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  33, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign, and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Jerusha the daughter of Zadok.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  34, 'He did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne; he did according to all that his father Uzziah had done.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  34, 'He did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes. He did according to all that his father Uzziah had done.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  35, 'However the high places were not taken away: the people still sacrificed and burned incense in the high places. He built the upper gate of the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  35, 'However the high places were not taken away. The people still sacrificed and burned incense in the high places. He built the upper gate of ForeverOne\'s house.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  37, 'In those days ForeverOne began to send against Judah Rezin the king of Syria, and Pekah the son of Remaliah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  37, 'In those days, ForeverOne began to send Rezin the king of Syria and Pekah the son of Remaliah against Judah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  38, 'Jotham slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in the city of David his father: and Ahaz his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  15,  38, 'Jotham slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in his father David\'s city; and Ahaz his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   1, 'In the seventeenth year of Pekah the son of Remaliah Ahaz the son of Jotham king of Judah began to reign.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   1, 'In the seventeenth year of Pekah the son of Remaliah, Ahaz the son of Jotham king of Judah began to reign.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   2, 'Twenty years old was Ahaz when he began to reign; and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem: and he didn\'t do that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne his God, like David his father.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   2, 'Ahaz was twenty years old when he began to reign, and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem. He didn\'t do that which was right in ForeverOne his God\'s eyes, like David his father.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   3, 'But he walked in the way of the kings of Israel, yes, and made his son to pass through the fire, according to the abominations of the nations, whom ForeverOne cast out from before the children of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   3, 'But he walked in the way of the kings of Israel, and even made his son to pass through the fire, according to the abominations of the nations whom ForeverOne cast out from before the children of Israel.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   4, 'He sacrificed and burnt incense in the high places, and on the hills, and under every green tree.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   4, 'He sacrificed and burned incense in the high places, on the hills, and under every green tree.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   5, 'Then Rezin king of Syria and Pekah son of Remaliah king of Israel came up to Jerusalem to war: and they besieged Ahaz, but could not overcome him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   5, 'Then Rezin king of Syria and Pekah son of Remaliah king of Israel came up to Jerusalem to wage war. They besieged Ahaz, but could not overcome him.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   6, 'At that time Rezin king of Syria recovered Elath to Syria, and drove the Jews from Elath; and the Syrians came to Elath, and lived there, to this day.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   6, 'At that time Rezin king of Syria recovered Elath to Syria, and drove the Jews from Elath; and the Syrians came to Elath, and lived there to this day.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   7, 'So Ahaz sent messengers to Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria, saying, \"I am your servant and your son. Come up, and save me out of the hand of the king of Syria, and out of the hand of the king of Israel, who rise up against me.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   7, 'So Ahaz sent messengers to Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria, saying, \"I am your servant and your son. Come up and save me out of the hand of the king of Syria and out of the hand of the king of Israel, who rise up against me.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   8, 'Ahaz took the silver and gold that was found in the house of ForeverOne, and in the treasures of the king\'s house, and sent it for a present to the king of Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   8, 'Ahaz took the silver and gold that was found in ForeverOne\'s house, and in the treasures of the king\'s house, and sent it for a present to the king of Assyria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   9, 'The king of Assyria listened to him; and the king of Assyria went up against Damascus, and took it, and carried [the people of] it captive to Kir, and killed Rezin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,   9, 'The king of Assyria listened to him; and the king of Assyria went up against Damascus and took it, and carried its people captive to Kir, and killed Rezin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  10, 'King Ahaz went to Damascus to meet Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria, and saw the altar that was at Damascus; and king Ahaz sent to Urijah the priest the fashion of the altar, and its pattern, according to all its workmanship.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  10, 'King Ahaz went to Damascus to meet Tiglath Pileser king of Assyria, and saw the altar that was at Damascus; and King Ahaz sent to Urijah the priest a drawing of the altar and plans to build it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  11, 'Urijah the priest built an altar: according to all that king Ahaz had sent from Damascus, so did Urijah the priest make it against the coming of king Ahaz from Damascus.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  11, 'Urijah the priest built an altar. According to all that King Ahaz had sent from Damascus, so Urijah the priest made it for the coming of King Ahaz from Damascus.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  12, 'When the king was come from Damascus, the king saw the altar: and the king drew near to the altar, and offered thereon.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  12, 'When the king had come from Damascus, the king saw the altar; and the king came near to the altar, and offered on it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  13, 'He burnt his burnt offering and his meal offering, and poured his drink offering, and sprinkled the blood of his peace offerings, on the altar.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  13, 'He burned his burnt offering and his meal offering, poured his drink offering, and sprinkled the blood of his peace offerings on the altar.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  14, 'The bronze altar, which was before ForeverOne, he brought from the forefront of the house, from between his altar and the house of ForeverOne, and put it on the north side of his altar.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  14, 'The bronze altar, which was before ForeverOne, he brought from the front of the house, from between his altar and ForeverOne\'s house, and put it on the north side of his altar.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  15, 'King Ahaz commanded Urijah the priest, saying, \"On the great altar burn the morning burnt offering, and the evening meal offering, and the king\'s burnt offering, and his meal offering, with the burnt offering of all the people of the land, and their meal offering, and their drink offerings; and sprinkle on it all the blood of the burnt offering, and all the blood of the sacrifice; but the bronze altar shall be for me to inquire by.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  15, 'King Ahaz commanded Urijah the priest, saying, \"On the great altar burn the morning burnt offering, the evening meal offering, the king\'s burnt offering and his meal offering, with the burnt offering of all the people of the land, their meal offering, and their drink offerings; and sprinkle on it all the blood of the burnt offering, and all the blood of the sacrifice; but the bronze altar will be for me to inquire by.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  16, 'Urijah the priest did so, according to all that king Ahaz commanded.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  16, 'Urijah the priest did so, according to all that King Ahaz commanded.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  18, 'The covered way for the Sabbath that they had built in the house, and the king\'s entry outside, turned he to the house of ForeverOne, because of the king of Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  18, 'He removed the covered way for the Sabbath that they had built in the house, and the king\'s outer entrance to ForeverOne\'s house, because of the king of Assyria.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  20, 'Ahaz slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in the city of David: and Hezekiah his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  16,  20, 'Ahaz slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in David\'s city; and Hezekiah his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   1, 'In the twelfth year of Ahaz king of Judah began Hoshea the son of Elah to reign in Samaria over Israel, [and reigned] nine years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   1, 'In the twelfth year of Ahaz king of Judah, Hoshea the son of Elah began to reign in Samaria over Israel for nine years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   2, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, yet not as the kings of Israel who were before him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   2, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, yet not as the kings of Israel who were before him.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   3, 'Against him came up Shalmaneser king of Assyria; and Hoshea became his servant, and brought him tribute.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   3, 'Shalmaneser king of Assyria came up against him; and Hoshea became his servant, and brought him tribute.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   4, 'The king of Assyria found conspiracy in Hoshea; for he had sent messengers to So king of Egypt, and offered no tribute to the king of Assyria, as he had done year by year: therefore the king of Assyria shut him up, and bound him in prison.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   4, 'The king of Assyria discovered a conspiracy in Hoshea; for he had sent messengers to So king of Egypt, and offered no tribute to the king of Assyria, as he had done year by year. Therefore the king of Assyria seized him, and bound him in prison.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   5, 'Then the king of Assyria came up throughout all the land, and went up to Samaria, and besieged it three years.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   5, 'Then the king of Assyria came up throughout all the land, went up to Samaria, and besieged it three years.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   6, 'In the ninth year of Hoshea the king of Assyria took Samaria, and carried Israel away to Assyria, and placed them in Halah, and on the Habor, the river of Gozan, and in the cities of the Medes.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   6, 'In the ninth year of Hoshea the king of Assyria took Samaria and carried Israel away to Assyria, and placed them in Halah, and on the Habor, the river of Gozan, and in the cities of the Medes.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   7, 'It was so, because the children of Israel had sinned against ForeverOne their God, who brought them up out of the land of Egypt from under the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt, and had feared other gods,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   7, 'It was so because the children of Israel had sinned against ForeverOne their God, who brought them up out of the land of Egypt from under the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt, and had feared other gods,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   8, 'and walked in the statutes of the nations, whom ForeverOne cast out from before the children of Israel, and of the kings of Israel, which they made.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   8, 'and walked in the statutes of the nations whom ForeverOne cast out from before the children of Israel, and of the kings of Israel, which they made.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   9, 'The children of Israel did secretly things that were not right against ForeverOne their God: and they built them high places in all their cities, from the tower of the watchmen to the fortified city;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,   9, 'The children of Israel secretly did things that were not right against ForeverOne their God; and they built high places for themselves in all their cities, from the tower of the watchmen to the fortified city;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  10, 'and they set them up pillars and Asherim on every high hill, and under every green tree;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  10, 'and they set up for themselves pillars and Asherah poles on every high hill and under every green tree;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  11, 'and there they burnt incense in all the high places, as did the nations whom ForeverOne carried away before them; and they worked wicked things to provoke ForeverOne to anger;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  11, 'and there they burned incense in all the high places, as the nations whom ForeverOne carried away before them did; and they did wicked things to provoke ForeverOne to anger;');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  13, 'Yet ForeverOne testified to Israel, and to Judah, by every prophet, and every seer, saying, \"Turn from your evil ways, and keep my commandments and my statutes, according to all the law which I commanded your fathers, and which I sent to you by my servants the prophets.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  13, 'Yet ForeverOne testified to Israel and to Judah, by every prophet and every seer, saying, \"Turn from your evil ways, and keep my commandments and my statutes, according to all the law which I commanded your fathers, and which I sent to you by my servants the prophets.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  14, 'Notwithstanding, they would not listen, but hardened their neck, like the neck of their fathers, who didn\'t believe in ForeverOne their God.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  14, 'Notwithstanding, they would not listen, but hardened their neck like the neck of their fathers who didn\'t believe in ForeverOne their God.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  15, 'They rejected his statutes, and his covenant that he made with their fathers, and his testimonies which he testified to them; and they followed vanity, and became vain, and [went] after the nations that were around them, concerning whom ForeverOne had commanded them that they should not do like them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  15, 'They rejected his statutes and his covenant that he made with their fathers, and his testimonies which he testified to them; and they followed vanity, and became vain, and followed the nations that were around them, concerning whom ForeverOne had commanded them that they should not do like them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  16, 'They forsook all the commandments of ForeverOne their God, and made them molten images, even two calves, and made an Asherah, and worshiped all the army of the sky, and served Baal.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  16, 'They abandoned all the commandments of ForeverOne their God, and made molten images for themselves, even two calves, and made an Asherah, and worshiped all the army of the sky, and served Baal.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  17, 'They caused their sons and their daughters to pass through the fire, and used divination and enchantments, and sold themselves to do that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, to provoke him to anger.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  17, 'They caused their sons and their daughters to pass through the fire, used divination and enchantments, and sold themselves to do that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, to provoke him to anger.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  18, 'Therefore ForeverOne was very angry with Israel, and removed them out of his sight: there was none left but the tribe of Judah only.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  18, 'Therefore ForeverOne was very angry with Israel, and removed them out of his sight. There was none left but the tribe of Judah only.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  20, 'ForeverOne rejected all the offspring of Israel, and afflicted them, and delivered them into the hand of spoilers, until he had cast them out of his sight.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  20, 'ForeverOne rejected all the offspring of Israel, afflicted them, and delivered them into the hands of raiders, until he had cast them out of his sight.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  21, 'For he tore Israel from the house of David; and they made Jeroboam the son of Nebat king: and Jeroboam drove Israel from following ForeverOne, and made them sin a great sin.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  21, 'For he tore Israel from David\'s house; and they made Jeroboam the son of Nebat king; and Jeroboam drove Israel from following ForeverOne, and made them sin a great sin.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  22, 'The children of Israel walked in all the sins of Jeroboam which he did; they didn\'t depart from them;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  22, 'The children of Israel walked in all the sins of Jeroboam which he did; they didn\'t depart from them');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  23, 'until ForeverOne removed Israel out of his sight, as he spoke by all his servants the prophets. So Israel was carried away out of their own land to Assyria to this day.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  23, 'until ForeverOne removed Israel out of his sight, as he said by all his servants the prophets. So Israel was carried away out of their own land to Assyria to this day.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  24, 'The king of Assyria brought men from Babylon, and from Cuthah, and from Avva, and from Hamath and Sepharvaim, and placed them in the cities of Samaria instead of the children of Israel; and they possessed Samaria, and lived in the cities of it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  24, 'The king of Assyria brought people from Babylon, from Cuthah, from Avva, and from Hamath and Sepharvaim, and placed them in the cities of Samaria instead of the children of Israel; and they possessed Samaria and lived in its cities.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  25, 'So it was, at the beginning of their dwelling there, that they didn\'t fear ForeverOne: therefore ForeverOne sent lions among them, which killed some of them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  25, 'So it was, at the beginning of their dwelling there, that they didn\'t fear ForeverOne. Therefore ForeverOne sent lions among them, which killed some of them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  26, 'Therefore they spoke to the king of Assyria, saying, \"The nations which you have carried away, and placed in the cities of Samaria, don\'t know the law of the god of the land. Therefore he has sent lions among them, and behold, they kill them, because they don\'t know the law of the god of the land.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  26, 'Therefore they spoke to the king of Assyria, saying, \"The nations which you have carried away and placed in the cities of Samaria don\'t know the law of the god of the land. Therefore he has sent lions among them; and behold, they kill them, because they don\'t know the law of the god of the land.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  27, 'Then the king of Assyria commanded, saying, \"Carry there one of the priests whom you brought from there; and let them go and dwell there, and let him teach them the law of the god of the land.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  27, 'Then the king of Assyria commanded, saying, \"Carry there one of the priests whom you brought from there; and let him go and dwell there, and let him teach them the law of the god of the land.\"');
-
-
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  31, 'and the Avvites made Nibhaz and Tartak; and the Sepharvites burnt their children in the fire to Adrammelech and Anammelech, the gods of Sepharvaim.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  31, 'and the Avvites made Nibhaz and Tartak; and the Sepharvites burned their children in the fire to Adrammelech and Anammelech, the gods of Sepharvaim.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  32, 'So they feared ForeverOne, and made to them from among themselves priests of the high places, who sacrificed for them in the houses of the high places.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  32, 'So they feared ForeverOne, and also made from among themselves priests of the high places for themselves, who sacrificed for them in the houses of the high places.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  33, 'They feared ForeverOne, and served their own gods, after the ways of the nations from among whom they had been carried away.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  33, 'They feared ForeverOne, and also served their own gods, after the ways of the nations from among whom they had been carried away.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  34, 'To this day they do what they did before: they don\'t fear ForeverOne, neither do they follow their statutes, or their ordinances, or the law or the commandment which ForeverOne commanded the children of Jacob, whom he named Israel;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  34, 'To this day they do what they did before. They don\'t fear ForeverOne, and they do not follow the statutes, or the ordinances, or the law, or the commandment which ForeverOne commanded the children of Jacob, whom he named Israel;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  35, 'with whom ForeverOne had made a covenant, and commanded them, saying, \"You shall not fear other gods, nor bow yourselves to them, nor serve them, nor sacrifice to them;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  35, 'with whom ForeverOne had made a covenant and commanded them, saying, \"You shall not fear other gods, nor bow yourselves to them, nor serve them, nor sacrifice to them;');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  37, 'The statutes and the ordinances, and the law and the commandment, which he wrote for you, you shall observe to do forevermore. You shall not fear other gods.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  37, 'The statutes and the ordinances, and the law and the commandment which he wrote for you, you shall observe to do forever more. You shall not fear other gods.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  38, 'You shall not forget the covenant that I have made with you; neither shall you fear other gods.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  38, 'You shall not forget the covenant that I have made with you. You shall not fear other gods.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  39, 'But you shall fear ForeverOne your God; and he will deliver you out of the hand of all your enemies.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  39, 'But you shall fear ForeverOne your God, and he will deliver you out of the hand of all your enemies.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  40, 'However they did not listen, but they did what they did before.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  40, 'However they didn\'t listen, but they did what they did before.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  41, 'So these nations feared ForeverOne, and served their engraved images. Their children likewise, and their children\'s children, as their fathers did, so they do to this day.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  17,  41, 'So these nations feared ForeverOne, and also served their engraved images. Their children did likewise, and so did their children\'s children. They do as their fathers did to this day.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   1, 'Now it happened in the third year of Hoshea son of Elah king of Israel, that Hezekiah the son of Ahaz king of Judah began to reign.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   1, 'Now in the third year of Hoshea son of Elah king of Israel, Hezekiah the son of Ahaz king of Judah began to reign.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   2, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign; and he reigned twenty-nine years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Abi the daughter of Zechariah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   2, 'He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign, and he reigned twenty-nine years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Abi the daughter of Zechariah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   3, 'He did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne, according to all that David his father had done.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   3, 'He did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes, according to all that David his father had done.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   4, 'He removed the high places, and broke the pillars, and cut down the Asherah: and he broke in pieces the bronze serpent that Moses had made; for to those days the children of Israel did burn incense to it; and he called it Nehushtan.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   4, 'He removed the high places, broke the pillars, and cut down the Asherah. He also broke in pieces the bronze serpent that Moses had made, because in those days the children of Israel burned incense to it; and he called it Nehushtan.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   5, 'He trusted in ForeverOne, the God of Israel; so that after him was none like him among all the kings of Judah, nor [among them] that were before him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   5, 'He trusted in ForeverOne, the God of Israel, so that after him was no one like him among all the kings of Judah, nor among them that were before him.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   6, 'For he joined with ForeverOne; he didn\'t depart from following him, but kept his commandments, which ForeverOne commanded Moses.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   6, 'For he joined with ForeverOne. He didn\'t depart from following him, but kept his commandments, which ForeverOne commanded Moses.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   7, 'ForeverOne was with him; wherever he went forth he prospered: and he rebelled against the king of Assyria, and didn\'t serve him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   7, 'ForeverOne was with him. Wherever he went, he prospered. He rebelled against the king of Assyria, and didn\'t serve him.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   9, 'It happened in the fourth year of king Hezekiah, which was the seventh year of Hoshea son of Elah king of Israel, that Shalmaneser king of Assyria came up against Samaria, and besieged it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,   9, 'In the fourth year of King Hezekiah, which was the seventh year of Hoshea son of Elah king of Israel, Shalmaneser king of Assyria came up against Samaria and besieged it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  10, 'At the end of three years they took it: in the sixth year of Hezekiah, which was the ninth year of Hoshea king of Israel, Samaria was taken.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  10, 'At the end of three years they took it. In the sixth year of Hezekiah, which was the ninth year of Hoshea king of Israel, Samaria was taken.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  12, 'because they didn\'t obey the voice of ForeverOne their God, but transgressed his covenant, even all that Moses the servant of ForeverOne commanded, and would not hear it, nor do it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  12, 'because they didn\'t obey ForeverOne their God\'s voice, but transgressed his covenant, even all that Moses the servant of ForeverOne commanded, and would not hear it or do it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  13, 'Now in the fourteenth year of king Hezekiah did Sennacherib king of Assyria come up against all the fortified cities of Judah, and took them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  13, 'Now in the fourteenth year of King Hezekiah, Sennacherib king of Assyria came up against all the fortified cities of Judah and took them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  14, 'Hezekiah king of Judah sent to the king of Assyria to Lachish, saying, \"I have offended; return from me. That which you put on me, I will bear.\" The king of Assyria appointed to Hezekiah king of Judah three hundred talents of silver and thirty talents of gold.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  14, 'Hezekiah king of Judah sent to the king of Assyria at Lachish, saying, \"I have offended you. Withdraw from me. That which you put on me, I will bear.\" The king of Assyria appointed to Hezekiah king of Judah three hundred talents of silver and thirty talents of gold.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  15, 'Hezekiah gave [him] all the silver that was found in the house of ForeverOne, and in the treasures of the king\'s house.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  15, 'Hezekiah gave him all the silver that was found in ForeverOne\'s house and in the treasures of the king\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  16, 'At that time did Hezekiah cut off [the gold from] the doors of the temple of ForeverOne, and [from] the pillars which Hezekiah king of Judah had overlaid, and gave it to the king of Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  16, 'At that time, Hezekiah cut off the gold from the doors of ForeverOne\'s temple, and from the pillars which Hezekiah king of Judah had overlaid, and gave it to the king of Assyria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  17, 'The king of Assyria sent Tartan and Rabsaris and Rabshakeh from Lachish to king Hezekiah with a great army to Jerusalem. They went up and came to Jerusalem. When they were come up, they came and stood by the conduit of the upper pool, which is in the highway of the fuller\'s field.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  17, 'The king of Assyria sent Tartan, Rabsaris, and Rabshakeh from Lachish to King Hezekiah with a great army to Jerusalem. They went up and came to Jerusalem. When they had come up, they came and stood by the conduit of the upper pool, which is in the highway of the fuller\'s field.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  18, 'When they had called to the king, there came out to them Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, who was over the household, and Shebnah the scribe, and Joah the son of Asaph the recorder.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  18, 'When they had called to the king, Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, who was over the household, and Shebnah the scribe, and Joah the son of Asaph the recorder came out to them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  19, 'Rabshakeh said to them, \"Say now to Hezekiah, \'Thus says the great king, the king of Assyria, \"What confidence is this in which you trust?');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  19, 'Rabshakeh said to them, \"Say now to Hezekiah, \'The great king, the king of Assyria, says, \"What confidence is this in which you trust?');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  21, 'Now, behold, you trust in the staff of this bruised reed, even in Egypt. If a man leans on it, it will go into his hand, and pierce it. So is Pharaoh king of Egypt to all who trust on him.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  21, 'Now, behold, you trust in the staff of this bruised reed, even in Egypt. If a man leans on it, it will go into his hand and pierce it. So is Pharaoh king of Egypt to all who trust on him.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  22, 'But if you tell me, \'We trust in ForeverOne our God;\' isn\'t that he whose high places and whose altars Hezekiah has taken away, and has said to Judah and to Jerusalem, \'You shall worship before this altar in Jerusalem?\'');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  22, 'But if you tell me, \'We trust in ForeverOne our God,\' isn\'t that he whose high places and whose altars Hezekiah has taken away, and has said to Judah and to Jerusalem, \'You shall worship before this altar in Jerusalem?\'');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  23, 'Now therefore, please give pledges to my master the king of Assyria, and I will give you two thousand horses, if you are able on your part to set riders on them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  23, 'Now therefore, please give pledges to my master the king of Assyria, and I will give you two thousand horses if you are able on your part to set riders on them.');
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  26, 'Then Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, and Shebnah, and Joah, said to Rabshakeh, \"Please speak to your servants in the Syrian language; for we understand it. Don\'t speak with us in the Jews\' language, in the hearing of the people who are on the wall.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  26, 'Then Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, Shebnah, and Joah, said to Rabshakeh, \"Please speak to your servants in the Syrian language, for we understand it. Don\'t speak with us in the Jews\' language, in the hearing of the people who are on the wall.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  27, 'But Rabshakeh said to them, \"Has my master sent me to your master, and to you, to speak these words? Hasn\'t he sent me to the men who sit on the wall, to eat their own dung, and to drink their own water with you?\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  27, 'But Rabshakeh said to them, \"Has my master sent me to your master and to you, to speak these words? Hasn\'t he sent me to the men who sit on the wall, to eat their own dung, and to drink their own urine with you?\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  28, 'Then Rabshakeh stood, and cried with a loud voice in the Jews\' language, and spoke, saying, \"Hear the word of the great king, the king of Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  28, 'Then Rabshakeh stood and cried with a loud voice in the Jews\' language, and spoke, saying, \"Hear the word of the great king, the king of Assyria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  29, 'Thus says the king, \'Don\'t let Hezekiah deceive you; for he will not be able to deliver you out of his hand.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  29, 'The king says, \'Don\'t let Hezekiah deceive you, for he will not be able to deliver you out of his hand.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  30, 'Neither let Hezekiah make you trust in ForeverOne, saying, \"ForeverOne will surely deliver us, and this city shall not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  30, 'Don\'t let Hezekiah make you trust in ForeverOne, saying, \"ForeverOne will surely deliver us, and this city shall not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  31, 'Don\'t listen to Hezekiah.\' For thus says the king of Assyria, \'Make your peace with me, and come out to me; and everyone of you eat of his vine, and everyone of his fig tree, and everyone drink the waters of his own cistern;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  31, 'Don\'t listen to Hezekiah.\' For the king of Assyria says, \'Make your peace with me, and come out to me; and everyone of you eat from his own vine, and everyone from his own fig tree, and everyone drink water from his own cistern;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  32, 'until I come and take you away to a land like your own land, a land of grain and new wine, a land of bread and vineyards, a land of olive trees and of honey, that you may live, and not die. Don\'t listen to Hezekiah, when he persuades you, saying, \"ForeverOne will deliver us.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  32, 'until I come and take you away to a land like your own land, a land of grain and new wine, a land of bread and vineyards, a land of olive trees and of honey, that you may live and not die. Don\'t listen to Hezekiah when he persuades you, saying, \"ForeverOne will deliver us.\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  34, 'Where are the gods of Hamath, and of Arpad? Where are the gods of Sepharvaim, of Hena, and Ivvah? Have they delivered Samaria out of my hand?');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  34, 'Where are the gods of Hamath and of Arpad? Where are the gods of Sepharvaim, of Hena, and Ivvah? Have they delivered Samaria out of my hand?');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  36, 'But the people held their peace, and answered him not a word; for the king\'s commandment was, \"Don\'t answer him.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  36, 'But the people stayed quiet, and answered him not a word; for the king\'s commandment was, \"Don\'t answer him.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  37, 'Then Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, who was over the household, came with Shebna the scribe, and Joah the son of Asaph the recorder, to Hezekiah with their clothes torn, and told him the words of Rabshakeh.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  18,  37, 'Then Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, who was over the household, came with Shebna the scribe and Joah the son of Asaph the recorder to Hezekiah with their clothes torn, and told him Rabshakeh\'s words.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   1, 'It happened, when king Hezekiah heard it, that he tore his clothes, and covered himself with sackcloth, and went into the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   1, 'When King Hezekiah heard it, he tore his clothes, covered himself with sackcloth, and went into ForeverOne\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   2, 'He sent Eliakim, who was over the household, and Shebna the scribe, and the elders of the priests, covered with sackcloth, to Isaiah the prophet the son of Amoz.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   2, 'He sent Eliakim, who was over the household, Shebna the scribe, and the elders of the priests, covered with sackcloth, to Isaiah the prophet the son of Amoz.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   3, 'They said to him, \"Thus says Hezekiah, \'This day is a day of trouble, of rebuke, and of rejection; for the children have come to the point of birth, and there is no strength to deliver them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   3, 'They said to him, \"Hezekiah says, \'Today is a day of trouble, of rebuke, and of rejection; for the children have come to the point of birth, and there is no strength to deliver them.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   5, 'So the servants of king Hezekiah came to Isaiah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   5, 'So the servants of King Hezekiah came to Isaiah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   6, 'Isaiah said to them, \"Thus you shall tell your master, \'Thus says ForeverOne, \"Don\'t be afraid of the words that you have heard, with which the servants of the king of Assyria have blasphemed me.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   6, 'Isaiah said to them, \"Tell your master this: \'ForeverOne says, \"Don\'t be afraid of the words that you have heard, with which the servants of the king of Assyria have blasphemed me.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   8, 'So Rabshakeh returned, and found the king of Assyria warring against Libnah; for he had heard that he had departed from Lachish.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   8, 'So Rabshakeh returned and found the king of Assyria warring against Libnah; for he had heard that he had departed from Lachish.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   9, 'When he heard it said of Tirhakah king of Ethiopia, \"Behold, he has come out to fight against you, he sent messengers again to Hezekiah, saying,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,   9, 'When he heard it said of Tirhakah king of Ethiopia, \"Behold, he has come out to fight against you,\" he sent messengers again to Hezekiah, saying,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  10, '\'Thus you shall speak to Hezekiah king of Judah, saying, \"Don\'t let your God in whom you trust deceive you, saying, Jerusalem will not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  10, '\"Tell Hezekiah king of Judah this: \'Don\'t let your God in whom you trust deceive you, saying, Jerusalem will not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  12, 'Have the gods of the nations delivered them, which my fathers have destroyed, Gozan, and Haran, and Rezeph, and the children of Eden that were in Telassar?');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  12, 'Have the gods of the nations delivered them, which my fathers have destroyed- Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, and the children of Eden who were in Telassar?');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  13, 'Where is the king of Hamath, and the king of Arpad, and the king of the city of Sepharvaim, of Hena, and Ivvah?\"\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  13, 'Where is the king of Hamath, the king of Arpad, and the king of the city of Sepharvaim, of Hena, and Ivvah?\'\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  14, 'Hezekiah received the letter from the hand of the messengers, and read it. Then Hezekiah went up to the house of ForeverOne, and spread it before ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  14, 'Hezekiah received the letter from the hand of the messengers and read it. Then Hezekiah went up to ForeverOne\'s house, and spread it before ForeverOne.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  15, 'Hezekiah prayed before ForeverOne, and said, \"ForeverOne, the God of Israel, who sit [above] the cherubim, you are the God, even you alone, of all the kingdoms of the earth. You have made heaven and earth.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  15, 'Hezekiah prayed before ForeverOne, and said, \"ForeverOne, the God of Israel, who are enthroned above the cherubim, you are the God, even you alone, of all the kingdoms of the earth. You have made heaven and earth.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  16, 'Incline your ear, ForeverOne, and hear. Open your eyes, ForeverOne, and see. Hear the words of Sennacherib, with which he has sent to defy the living God.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  16, 'Incline your ear, ForeverOne, and hear. Open your eyes, ForeverOne, and see. Hear the words of Sennacherib, which he has sent to defy the living God.');
-
-
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  20, 'Then Isaiah the son of Amoz sent to Hezekiah, saying, \"Thus says ForeverOne, the God of Israel, \'Whereas you have prayed to me against Sennacherib king of Assyria, I have heard you.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  20, 'Then Isaiah the son of Amoz sent to Hezekiah, saying, \"ForeverOne, the God of Israel, says \'You have prayed to me against Sennacherib king of Assyria, and I have heard you.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  21, 'This is the word that ForeverOne has spoken concerning him: \"The virgin daughter of Zion has despised you and ridiculed you. The daughter of Jerusalem has shaken her head at you.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  21, 'This is the word that ForeverOne has spoken concerning him: \'The virgin daughter of Zion has despised you and ridiculed you. The daughter of Jerusalem has shaken her head at you.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  22, 'Whom have you defied and blasphemed? Against whom have you exalted your voice and lifted up your eyes on high? Against the Holy One of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  22, 'Whom have you defied and blasphemed? Against whom have you exalted your voice and lifted up your eyes on high? Against the Holy One of Israel!');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  23, 'By your messengers you have defied the Lord, and have said, \'With the multitude of my chariots, I have come up to the height of the mountains, to the innermost parts of Lebanon; and I will cut down its tall cedars, and its choice fir trees; and I will enter into his farthest lodging place, the forest of his fruitful field.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  23, 'By your messengers, you have defied the Lord, and have said, \"With the multitude of my chariots, I have come up to the height of the mountains, to the innermost parts of Lebanon, and I will cut down its tall cedars and its choice cypress trees; and I will enter into his farthest lodging place, the forest of his fruitful field.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  24, 'I have dug and drunk strange waters, and with the sole of my feet will I dry up all the rivers of Egypt.\'');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  24, 'I have dug and drunk strange waters, and I will dry up all the rivers of Egypt with the sole of my feet.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  25, 'Haven\'t you heard how I have done it long ago, and formed it of ancient times? Now have I brought it to pass, that it should be yours to lay waste fortified cities into ruinous heaps.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  25, 'Haven\'t you heard how I have done it long ago, and formed it of ancient times? Now I have brought it to pass, that it should be yours to lay waste fortified cities into ruinous heaps.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  26, 'Therefore their inhabitants were of small power. They were dismayed and confounded. They were like the grass of the field, and like the green vegetation, like the grass on the housetops, and like grain blasted before it has grown up.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  26, 'Therefore their inhabitants had little power. They were dismayed and confounded. They were like the grass of the field and like the green vegetation, like the grass on the housetops and like grain blasted before it has grown up.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  27, 'But I know your sitting down, and your going out, and your coming in, and your raging against me.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  27, 'But I know your sitting down, your going out, your coming in, and your raging against me.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  28, 'Because of your raging against me, and because your arrogance has come up into my ears, therefore will I put my hook in your nose, and my bridle in your lips, and I will turn you back by the way by which you came.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  28, 'Because of your raging against me, and because your arrogance has come up into my ears, therefore I will put my hook in your nose, and my bridle in your lips, and I will turn you back by the way by which you came.\'');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  29, '\"\'This shall be the sign to you: You shall eat this year that which grows of itself, and in the second year that which springs of the same; and in the third year sow, and reap, and plant vineyards, and eat its fruit.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  29, '\"This will be the sign to you: This year, you will eat that which grows of itself, and in the second year that which springs from that; and in the third year sow and reap, and plant vineyards and eat their fruit.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  30, 'The remnant that has escaped of the house of Judah shall again take root downward, and bear fruit upward.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  30, 'The remnant that has escaped of the house of Judah will again take root downward, and bear fruit upward.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  31, 'For out of Jerusalem a remnant will go out, and out of Mount Zion those who shall escape. The zeal of ForeverOne will perform this.\'');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  31, 'For out of Jerusalem a remnant will go out, and out of Mount Zion those who shall escape. ForeverOne\'s zeal will perform this.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  32, '\"Therefore thus says ForeverOne concerning the king of Assyria, \'He shall not come to this city, nor shoot an arrow there, neither shall he come before it with shield, nor cast up a mound against it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  32, '\"Therefore ForeverOne says concerning the king of Assyria, \'He will not come to this city, nor shoot an arrow there. He will not come before it with shield, nor cast up a mound against it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  33, 'By the way that he came, by the same shall he return, and he shall not come to this city,\' says ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  33, 'He will return the same way that he came, and he will not come to this city,\' says ForeverOne.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  34, '\'For I will defend this city to save it, for my own sake, and for my servant David\'s sake.\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  34, '\'For I will defend this city to save it, for my own sake and for my servant David\'s sake.\'\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  35, 'It happened that night, that the angel of ForeverOne went out, and struck one hundred eighty-five thousand in the camp of the Assyrians. When men arose early in the morning, behold, these were all dead bodies.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  35, 'That night, ForeverOne\'s angel went out and struck one hundred eighty-five thousand in the camp of the Assyrians. When men arose early in the morning, behold, these were all dead bodies.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  36, 'So Sennacherib king of Assyria departed, and went and returned, and lived at Nineveh.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  36, 'So Sennacherib king of Assyria departed, went home, and lived at Nineveh.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  37, 'It happened, as he was worshipping in the house of Nisroch his god, that Adrammelech and Sharezer struck him with the sword; and they escaped into the land of Ararat. Esar Haddon his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  19,  37, 'As he was worshiping in the house of Nisroch his god, Adrammelech and Sharezer struck him with the sword; and they escaped into the land of Ararat. Esar Haddon his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   1, 'In those days was Hezekiah sick to death. Isaiah the prophet the son of Amoz came to him, and said to him, \"Thus says ForeverOne, \'Set your house in order; for you shall die, and not live.\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   1, 'In those days Hezekiah was sick and dying. Isaiah the prophet the son of Amoz came to him, and said to him, \"ForeverOne says, \'Set your house in order; for you will die, and not live.\'\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   3, '\"Remember now, ForeverOne, I beg you, how I have walked before you in truth and with a perfect heart, and have done that which is good in your sight.\" Hezekiah wept bitterly.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   3, '\"Remember now, ForeverOne, I beg you, how I have walked before you in truth and with a perfect heart, and have done that which is good in your sight.\" And Hezekiah wept bitterly.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   4, 'It happened, before Isaiah had gone out into the middle part of the city, that the word of ForeverOne came to him, saying,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   4, 'Before Isaiah had gone out into the middle part of the city, ForeverOne\'s word came to him, saying,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   5, '\"Turn back, and tell Hezekiah the prince of my people, \'Thus says ForeverOne, the God of David your father, \"I have heard your prayer. I have seen your tears. Behold, I will heal you. On the third day, you shall go up to the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   5, '\"Turn back, and tell Hezekiah the prince of my people, \'ForeverOne, the God of David your father, says, \"I have heard your prayer. I have seen your tears. Behold, I will heal you. On the third day, you will go up to ForeverOne\'s house.');
-
-
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   8, 'Hezekiah said to Isaiah, \"What shall be the sign that ForeverOne will heal me, and that I shall go up to the house of ForeverOne the third day?\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   8, 'Hezekiah said to Isaiah, \"What will be the sign that ForeverOne will heal me, and that I will go up to ForeverOne\'s house the third day?\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   9, 'Isaiah said, \"This shall be the sign to you from ForeverOne, that ForeverOne will do the thing that he has spoken: shall the shadow go forward ten steps, or go back ten steps?\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,   9, 'Isaiah said, \"This will be the sign to you from ForeverOne, that ForeverOne will do the thing that he has spoken: should the shadow go forward ten steps, or go back ten steps?\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  10, 'Hezekiah answered, \"It is a light thing for the shadow to go forward ten steps. Nay, but let the shadow return backward ten steps.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  10, 'Hezekiah answered, \"It is a light thing for the shadow to go forward ten steps. No, but let the shadow return backward ten steps.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  11, 'Isaiah the prophet cried to ForeverOne; and he brought the shadow ten steps backward, by which it had gone down on the dial of Ahaz.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  11, 'Isaiah the prophet cried to ForeverOne; and he brought the shadow ten steps backward, by which it had gone down on the sundial of Ahaz.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  12, 'At that time Berodach Baladan the son of Baladan, king of Babylon, sent letters and a present to Hezekiah; for he had heard that Hezekiah had been sick.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  12, 'At that time Berodach Baladan the son of Baladan, king of Babylon, sent letters and a present to Hezekiah, for he had heard that Hezekiah had been sick.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  13, 'Hezekiah listened to them, and showed them all the house of his precious things, the silver, and the gold, and the spices, and the precious oil, and the house of his armor, and all that was found in his treasures: there was nothing in his house, nor in all his dominion, that Hezekiah didn\'t show them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  13, 'Hezekiah listened to them, and showed them all the storehouse of his precious things- the silver, the gold, the spices, and the precious oil, and the house of his armor, and all that was found in his treasures. There was nothing in his house, or in all his dominion, that Hezekiah didn\'t show them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  14, 'Then Isaiah the prophet came to king Hezekiah, and said to him, \"What did these men say? From where did they come to you?\" Hezekiah said, \"They are come from a far country, even from Babylon.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  14, 'Then Isaiah the prophet came to King Hezekiah, and said to him, \"What did these men say? From where did they come to you?\" Hezekiah said, \"They have come from a far country, even from Babylon.\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  16, 'Isaiah said to Hezekiah, \"Hear the word of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  16, 'Isaiah said to Hezekiah, \"Hear ForeverOne\'s word.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  17, '\'Behold, the days come, that all that is in your house, and that which your fathers have laid up in store to this day, shall be carried to Babylon. Nothing shall be left,\' says ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  17, '\'Behold, the days come that all that is in your house, and that which your fathers have laid up in store to this day, will be carried to Babylon. Nothing will be left,\' says ForeverOne.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  18, '\'Of your sons who shall issue from you, whom you shall father, shall they take away; and they shall be eunuchs in the palace of the king of Babylon.\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  18, '\'They will take away some of your sons who will issue from you, whom you will father; and they will be eunuchs in the palace of the king of Babylon.\'\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  19, 'Then Hezekiah said to Isaiah, \"The word of ForeverOne which you have spoken is good.\" He said moreover, \"Isn\'t it so, if peace and truth shall be in my days?\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  19, 'Then Hezekiah said to Isaiah, \"ForeverOne\'s word which you have spoken is good.\" He said moreover, \"Isn\'t it so, if peace and truth will be in my days?\"');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  21, 'Hezekiah slept with his fathers; and Manasseh his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  20,  21, 'Hezekiah slept with his fathers, and Manasseh his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   1, 'Manasseh was twelve years old when he began to reign; and he reigned fifty-five years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Hephzibah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   1, 'Manasseh was twelve years old when he began to reign, and he reigned fifty-five years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Hephzibah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   2, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, after the abominations of the nations whom ForeverOne cast out before the children of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   2, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, after the abominations of the nations whom ForeverOne cast out before the children of Israel.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   3, 'For he built again the high places which Hezekiah his father had destroyed; and he reared up altars for Baal, and made an Asherah, as did Ahab king of Israel, and worshiped all the army of the sky, and served them.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   3, 'For he built again the high places which Hezekiah his father had destroyed; and he raised up altars for Baal, and made an Asherah, as Ahab king of Israel did, and worshiped all the army of the sky, and served them.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   4, 'He built altars in the house of ForeverOne, of which ForeverOne said, \"I will put my name in Jerusalem.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   4, 'He built altars in ForeverOne\'s house, of which ForeverOne said, \"I will put my name in Jerusalem.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   5, 'He built altars for all the army of the sky in the two courts of the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   5, 'He built altars for all the army of the sky in the two courts of ForeverOne\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   6, 'He made his son to pass through the fire, and practiced sorcery, and used enchantments, and dealt with those who had familiar spirits, and with wizards: he worked much evil in the sight of ForeverOne, to provoke him to anger.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   6, 'He made his son to pass through the fire, practiced sorcery, used enchantments, and dealt with those who had familiar spirits and with wizards. He did much evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, to provoke him to anger.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   7, 'He set the engraved image of Asherah, that he had made, in the house of which ForeverOne said to David and to Solomon his son, \"In this house, and in Jerusalem, which I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel, will I put my name forever;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   7, 'He set the engraved image of Asherah that he had made in the house of which ForeverOne said to David and to Solomon his son, \"In this house, and in Jerusalem, which I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel, I will put my name forever;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   8, 'neither will I cause the feet of Israel to wander any more out of the land which I gave their fathers, if only they will observe to do according to all that I have commanded them, and according to all the law that my servant Moses commanded them.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   8, 'I will not cause the feet of Israel to wander any more out of the land which I gave their fathers, if only they will observe to do according to all that I have commanded them, and according to all the law that my servant Moses commanded them.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   9, 'But they didn\'t listen: and Manasseh seduced them to do that which is evil more than did the nations whom ForeverOne destroyed before the children of Israel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,   9, 'But they didn\'t listen, and Manasseh seduced them to do that which is evil more than the nations did whom ForeverOne destroyed before the children of Israel.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  11, '\"Because Manasseh king of Judah has done these abominations, and has done wickedly above all that the Amorites did, who were before him, and has made Judah also to sin with his idols;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  11, '\"Because Manasseh king of Judah has done these abominations, and has done wickedly above all that the Amorites did, who were before him, and has also made Judah to sin with his idols;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  12, 'therefore thus says ForeverOne, the God of Israel, \'Behold, I bring such evil on Jerusalem and Judah, that whoever hears of it, both his ears shall tingle.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  12, 'therefore ForeverOne the God of Israel says, \'Behold, I will bring such evil on Jerusalem and Judah that whoever hears of it, both his ears will tingle.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  13, 'I will stretch over Jerusalem the line of Samaria, and the plummet of the house of Ahab; and I will wipe Jerusalem as a man wipes a dish, wiping it and turning it upside down.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  13, 'I will stretch over Jerusalem the line of Samaria, and the plumb line of Ahab\'s house; and I will wipe Jerusalem as a man wipes a dish, wiping it and turning it upside down.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  14, 'I will cast off the remnant of my inheritance, and deliver them into the hand of their enemies. They will become a prey and a spoil to all their enemies;');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  14, 'I will cast off the remnant of my inheritance and deliver them into the hands of their enemies. They will become a prey and a plunder to all their enemies,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  15, 'because they have done that which is evil in my sight, and have provoked me to anger, since the day their fathers came forth out of Egypt, even to this day.\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  15, 'because they have done that which is evil in my sight, and have provoked me to anger since the day their fathers came out of Egypt, even to this day.\'\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  16, 'Moreover Manasseh shed innocent blood very much, until he had filled Jerusalem from one end to another; besides his sin with which he made Judah to sin, in doing that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  16, 'Moreover Manasseh shed innocent blood very much, until he had filled Jerusalem from one end to another; in addition to his sin with which he made Judah to sin, in doing that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  18, 'Manasseh slept with his fathers, and was buried in the garden of his own house, in the garden of Uzza: and Amon his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  18, 'Manasseh slept with his fathers, and was buried in the garden of his own house, in the garden of Uzza; and Amon his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  19, 'Amon was twenty-two years old when he began to reign; and he reigned two years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Meshullemeth the daughter of Haruz of Jotbah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  19, 'Amon was twenty-two years old when he began to reign; and he reigned two years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Meshullemeth the daughter of Haruz of Jotbah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  20, 'He did that which was evil in the sight of ForeverOne, as did Manasseh his father.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  20, 'He did that which was evil in ForeverOne\'s sight, as Manasseh his father did.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  21, 'He walked in all the way that his father walked in, and served the idols that his father served, and worshiped them:');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  21, 'He walked in all the ways that his father walked in, and served the idols that his father served, and worshiped them;');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  22, 'and he forsook ForeverOne, the God of his fathers, and didn\'t walk in the way of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  22, 'and he abandoned ForeverOne, the God of his fathers, and didn\'t walk in the way of ForeverOne.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  24, 'But the people of the land killed all those who had conspired against king Amon; and the people of the land made Josiah his son king in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  24, 'But the people of the land killed all those who had conspired against King Amon; and the people of the land made Josiah his son king in his place.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  26, 'He was buried in his tomb in the garden of Uzza: and Josiah his son reigned in his place.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  21,  26, 'He was buried in his tomb in the garden of Uzza, and Josiah his son reigned in his place.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   1, 'Josiah was eight years old when he began to reign; and he reigned thirty-one years in Jerusalem: and his mother\'s name was Jedidah the daughter of Adaiah of Bozkath.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   1, 'Josiah was eight years old when he began to reign, and he reigned thirty-one years in Jerusalem. His mother\'s name was Jedidah the daughter of Adaiah of Bozkath.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   2, 'He did that which was right in the eyes of ForeverOne, and walked in all the way of David his father, and didn\'t turn aside to the right hand or to the left.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   2, 'He did that which was right in ForeverOne\'s eyes, and walked in all the way of David his father, and didn\'t turn away to the right hand or to the left.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   3, 'It happened in the eighteenth year of king Josiah, that the king sent Shaphan, the son of Azaliah the son of Meshullam, the scribe, to the house of ForeverOne, saying,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   3, 'In the eighteenth year of King Josiah, the king sent Shaphan, the son of Azaliah the son of Meshullam, the scribe, to ForeverOne\'s house, saying,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   4, '\"Go up to Hilkiah the high priest, that he may sum the money which is brought into the house of ForeverOne, which the keepers of the threshold have gathered of the people.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   4, '\"Go up to Hilkiah the high priest, that he may count the money which is brought into ForeverOne\'s house, which the keepers of the threshold have gathered of the people.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   5, 'Let them deliver it into the hand of the workmen who have the oversight of the house of ForeverOne; and let them give it to the workmen who are in the house of ForeverOne, to repair the breaches of the house,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   5, 'Let them deliver it into the hand of the workers who have the oversight of ForeverOne\'s house; and let them give it to the workers who are in ForeverOne\'s house, to repair the damage to the house,');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   7, 'However there was no accounting made with them of the money that was delivered into their hand; for they dealt faithfully.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   7, 'However, no accounting shall be asked of them for the money delivered into their hand, for they deal faithfully.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   8, 'Hilkiah the high priest said to Shaphan the scribe, \"I have found the book of the law in the house of ForeverOne.\" Hilkiah delivered the book to Shaphan, and he read it.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   8, 'Hilkiah the high priest said to Shaphan the scribe, \"I have found the book of the law in ForeverOne\'s house.\" Hilkiah delivered the book to Shaphan, and he read it.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   9, 'Shaphan the scribe came to the king, and brought the king word again, and said, \"Your servants have emptied out the money that was found in the house, and have delivered it into the hand of the workmen who have the oversight of the house of ForeverOne.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,   9, 'Shaphan the scribe came to the king, and brought the king word again, and said, \"Your servants have emptied out the money that was found in the house, and have delivered it into the hands of the workmen who have the oversight of ForeverOne\'s house.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  10, 'Shaphan the scribe told the king, saying, \"Hilkiah the priest has delivered a book to me.\" Shaphan read it before the king.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  10, 'Shaphan the scribe told the king, saying, \"Hilkiah the priest has delivered a book to me.\" Then Shaphan read it before the king.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  11, 'It happened, when the king had heard the words of the book of the law, that he tore his clothes.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  11, 'When the king had heard the words of the book of the law, he tore his clothes.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  12, 'The king commanded Hilkiah the priest, and Ahikam the son of Shaphan, and Achbor the son of Micaiah, and Shaphan the scribe, and Asaiah the king\'s servant, saying,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  12, 'The king commanded Hilkiah the priest, Ahikam the son of Shaphan, Achbor the son of Micaiah, Shaphan the scribe, and Asaiah the king\'s servant, saying,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  13, '\"Go inquire of ForeverOne for me, and for the people, and for all Judah, concerning the words of this book that is found; for great is the wrath of ForeverOne that is kindled against us, because our fathers have not listened to the words of this book, to do according to all that which is written concerning us.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  13, '\"Go inquire of ForeverOne for me, and for the people, and for all Judah, concerning the words of this book that is found; for great is ForeverOne\'s wrath that is kindled against us, because our fathers have not listened to the words of this book, to do according to all that which is written concerning us.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  14, 'So Hilkiah the priest, and Ahikam, and Achbor, and Shaphan, and Asaiah, went to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum the son of Tikvah, the son of Harhas, keeper of the wardrobe (now she lived in Jerusalem in the second quarter); and they talked with her.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  14, 'So Hilkiah the priest, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan, and Asaiah went to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum the son of Tikvah, the son of Harhas, keeper of the wardrobe (now she lived in Jerusalem in the second quarter); and they talked with her.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  15, 'She said to them, \"Thus says ForeverOne, the God of Israel: \'Tell the man who sent you to me,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  15, 'She said to them, \"ForeverOne the God of Israel says, \'Tell the man who sent you to me,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  16, '\"Thus says ForeverOne, \'Behold, I will bring evil on this place, and on its inhabitants, even all the words of the book which the king of Judah has read.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  16, '\"ForeverOne says, \'Behold, I will bring evil on this place and on its inhabitants, even all the words of the book which the king of Judah has read.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  17, 'Because they have forsaken me, and have burned incense to other gods, that they might provoke me to anger with all the work of their hands, therefore my wrath shall be kindled against this place, and it shall not be quenched.\'\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  17, 'Because they have forsaken me and have burned incense to other gods, that they might provoke me to anger with all the work of their hands, therefore my wrath shall be kindled against this place, and it will not be quenched.\'\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  18, 'But to the king of Judah, who sent you to inquire of ForeverOne, thus you shall tell him, \"Thus says ForeverOne, the God of Israel: \'Concerning the words which you have heard,');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  18, 'But to the king of Judah, who sent you to inquire of ForeverOne, tell him, \"ForeverOne the God of Israel says, \'Concerning the words which you have heard,');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  19, 'because your heart was tender, and you humbled yourself before ForeverOne, when you heard what I spoke against this place, and against its inhabitants, that they should become a desolation and a curse, and have torn your clothes, and wept before me; I also have heard you,\' says ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  19, 'because your heart was tender, and you humbled yourself before ForeverOne when you heard what I spoke against this place and against its inhabitants, that they should become a desolation and a curse, and have torn your clothes and wept before me, I also have heard you,\' says ForeverOne.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  20, '\'Therefore, behold, I will gather you to your fathers, and you shall be gathered to your grave in peace, neither shall your eyes see all the evil which I will bring on this place.\'\"\'\" They brought back this message to the king.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  22,  20, '\'Therefore behold, I will gather you to your fathers, and you will be gathered to your grave in peace. Your eyes will not see all the evil which I will bring on this place.\'\"\'\" So they brought this message back to the king.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   2, 'The king went up to the house of ForeverOne, and all the men of Judah and all the inhabitants of Jerusalem with him, and the priests, and the prophets, and all the people, both small and great: and he read in their ears all the words of the book of the covenant which was found in the house of ForeverOne.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   2, 'The king went up to ForeverOne\'s house, and all the men of Judah and all the inhabitants of Jerusalem with him- with the priests, the prophets, and all the people, both small and great; and he read in their hearing all the words of the book of the covenant which was found in ForeverOne\'s house.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   3, 'The king stood by the pillar, and made a covenant before ForeverOne, to walk after ForeverOne, and to keep his commandments, and his testimonies, and his statutes, with all [his] heart, and all [his] soul, to confirm the words of this covenant that were written in this book: and all the people stood to the covenant.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   3, 'The king stood by the pillar and made a covenant before ForeverOne to walk after ForeverOne and to keep his commandments, his testimonies, and his statutes with all his heart and all his soul, to confirm the words of this covenant that were written in this book; and all the people agreed to the covenant.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   4, 'The king commanded Hilkiah the high priest, and the priests of the second order, and the keepers of the threshold, to bring forth out of the temple of ForeverOne all the vessels that were made for Baal, and for the Asherah, and for all the army of the sky, and he burned them outside of Jerusalem in the fields of the Kidron, and carried the ashes of them to Bethel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   4, 'The king commanded Hilkiah the high priest, and the priests of the second order, and the keepers of the threshold, to bring out of ForeverOne\'s temple all the vessels that were made for Baal, for the Asherah, and for all the army of the sky; and he burned them outside of Jerusalem in the fields of the Kidron, and carried their ashes to Bethel.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   5, 'He put down the idolatrous priests, whom the kings of Judah had ordained to burn incense in the high places in the cities of Judah, and in the places around Jerusalem; those also who burned incense to Baal, to the sun, and to the moon, and to the planets, and to all the army of the sky.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   5, 'He got rid of the idolatrous priests whom the kings of Judah had ordained to burn incense in the high places in the cities of Judah and in the places around Jerusalem; those also who burned incense to Baal, to the sun, to the moon, to the planets, and to all the army of the sky.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   6, 'He brought out the Asherah from the house of ForeverOne, outside of Jerusalem, to the brook Kidron, and burned it at the brook Kidron, and beat it to dust, and cast its dust on the graves of the common people.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   6, 'He brought out the Asherah from ForeverOne\'s house, outside of Jerusalem, to the brook Kidron, and burned it at the brook Kidron, and beat it to dust, and cast its dust on the graves of the common people.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   7, 'He broke down the houses of the sodomites, that were in the house of ForeverOne, where the women wove hangings for the Asherah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   7, 'He broke down the houses of the male shrine prostitutes that were in ForeverOne\'s house, where the women wove hangings for the Asherah.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   9, 'Nevertheless the priests of the high places didn\'t come up to the altar of ForeverOne in Jerusalem, but they ate unleavened bread among their brothers.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,   9, 'Nevertheless the priests of the high places didn\'t come up to ForeverOne\'s altar in Jerusalem, but they ate unleavened bread among their brothers.');
-
-
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  11, 'He took away the horses that the kings of Judah had given to the sun, at the entrance of the house of ForeverOne, by the room of Nathan Melech the officer, who was in the court; and he burned the chariots of the sun with fire.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  11, 'He took away the horses that the kings of Judah had dedicated to the sun, at the entrance of ForeverOne\'s house, by the room of Nathan Melech the officer who was in the court; and he burned the chariots of the sun with fire.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  12, 'The altars that were on the roof of the upper room of Ahaz, which the kings of Judah had made, and the altars which Manasseh had made in the two courts of the house of ForeverOne, did the king break down, and beat [them] down from there, and cast the dust of them into the brook Kidron.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  12, 'The king broke down the altars that were on the roof of the upper room of Ahaz, which the kings of Judah had made, and the altars which Manasseh had made in the two courts of ForeverOne\'s house, and beat them down from there, and cast their dust into the brook Kidron.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  13, 'The high places that were before Jerusalem, which were on the right hand of the mountain of corruption, which Solomon the king of Israel had built for Ashtoreth the abomination of the Sidonians, and for Chemosh the abomination of Moab, and for Milcom the abomination of the children of Ammon, did the king defile.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  13, 'The king defiled the high places that were before Jerusalem, which were on the right hand of the mountain of corruption, which Solomon the king of Israel had built for Ashtoreth the abomination of the Sidonians, and for Chemosh the abomination of Moab, and for Milcom the abomination of the children of Ammon.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  14, 'He broke in pieces the pillars, and cut down the Asherim, and filled their places with the bones of men.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  14, 'He broke in pieces the pillars, cut down the Asherah poles, and filled their places with men\'s bones.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  15, 'Moreover the altar that was at Bethel, and the high place which Jeroboam the son of Nebat, who made Israel to sin, had made, even that altar and the high place he broke down; and he burned the high place and beat it to dust, and burned the Asherah.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  15, 'Moreover the altar that was at Bethel and the high place which Jeroboam the son of Nebat, who made Israel to sin, had made, even that altar and the high place he broke down; and he burned the high place and beat it to dust, and burned the Asherah.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  16, 'As Josiah turned himself, he spied the tombs that were there in the mountain; and he sent, and took the bones out of the tombs, and burned them on the altar, and defiled it, according to the word of ForeverOne which the man of God proclaimed, who proclaimed these things.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  16, 'As Josiah turned himself, he spied the tombs that were there in the mountain; and he sent, and took the bones out of the tombs, and burned them on the altar, and defiled it, according to ForeverOne\'s word which the man of God proclaimed, who proclaimed these things.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  17, 'Then he said, \"What monument is that which I see?\" The men of the city told him, \"It is the tomb of the man of God, who came from Judah, and proclaimed these things that you have done against the altar of Bethel.\"');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  17, 'Then he said, \"What monument is that which I see?\" The men of the city told him, \"It is the tomb of the man of God who came from Judah and proclaimed these things that you have done against the altar of Bethel.\"');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  18, 'He said, \"Let him be! Let no man move his bones.\" So they let his bones alone, with the bones of the prophet who came out of Samaria.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  18, 'He said, \"Let him be! Let no one move his bones.\" So they let his bones alone, with the bones of the prophet who came out of Samaria.');
INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  19, 'All the houses also of the high places that were in the cities of Samaria, which the kings of Israel had made to provoke [ForeverOne] to anger, Josiah took away, and did to them according to all the acts that he had done in Bethel.');
--INSERT INTO `verses` (`bookCode`, `chapter`, `verseNumber`, `verseText`) VALUES ('2KI',  23,  19, 'All the houses also of the high places that were in the cities of Samaria, which the kings of Israel had made to provoke ForeverOne to anger, Josiah took away, and did to them according to all the acts that he had done in Bethel.');
